msgstr "Tomar control de todos modos"

#: plasmoid/package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:109
msgid ""
"Force this widget to become active. The other instance will become passive "
"at the next refresh (3 s)."
msgstr ""
"Forzar que este widget pase a estar activo. La otra instancia pasará a estar "
"pasiva en la próxima actualización (3 s)."

